\newlabel{fig:calibration_eicu}{{5.10}{41}{eICU calibration by risk decile: the frozen MIMIC model (red) over-predicts, and a single-parameter recalibration (blue) restores agreement with observed onset rates. The dashed grey line marks perfect calibration}{figure.5.10}{}}
